{{ template "header" .}}<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pb-2 mb-3 border-bottom"><h1 class="h2">已授权市场报表</h1></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><p>本页为只读汇总视图。账户标识和公开供应分类用于运营分析；不提供 JSON 导出、实验盐值、审计原因、凭据、私有合同或结算操作。</p><form method="get" action="ledger"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="topicsMarketplace"><label for="day">截止日期</label><input id="day" type="date" name="day" value="{{index .ARGS.day 0}}"><label for="idays">回溯天数</label><input id="idays" type="number" min="0" max="90" name="idays" value="{{index .ARGS.idays 0}}"><label for="top">行数</label><input id="top" type="number" min="1" max="200" name="top" value="{{index .ARGS.top 0}}"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">查看</button></form></div></div><div class="card mt-3"><div class="card-body table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>来源</th><th>广告主 / 活动</th><th>流量方 / 流量源 / 广告位</th><th>流量分类 / 卖方</th><th>曝光 / 点击</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Lists}}<tr><td>{{.demand_source}}</td><td>{{.adv_id}} / {{.campaign_id}}</td><td>{{.pub_id}} / {{.site_id}} / {{.slot_id}}</td><td>{{.inventory_environment}} / {{.integration_mode}} / {{.placement}} / {{.traffic_quality}} / {{.seller_type}}</td><td>{{.imps}} / {{.clis}}</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div></div>{{ template "footer" .}}
